<title>USA: All-Comm chairman to leave company.</title>
<headline>All-Comm chairman to leave company.</headline>
<dateline>CULVER CITY, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>All-Comm Media Corp said on Tuesday chairman and chief executive officer Barry Peters will be leaving the company to develop new ventures in media-related properties.</p>
<p>Under a restructuring program, All-Comm is closing its corporate offices in Culver City, Calif and shifting management responsibility to Metro Services Group Inc, an All-Comm unit, the company said.</p>
<p>All-Comm Media provides database marketing services and custom telemarketing and telefundraising services.</p>
